Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-tearfree-modesetting
Version: 1.6-5
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: xlibre, devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-dmabuf
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Tearfree improvements to the modesetting driver
 X11 device section for the modesetting driver (Intel and AMD) with
 TearFree, atomic mode setting and variable refresh enabled and the
 shadow framebuffer disabled. Atomic mode setting needs XLibre or a
 patched Xorg.
